/strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034530/extras/de531e1edd17269b1dbb4f92df99ab29.poster.avif?t=1751566197\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034530/extras/de531e1edd17269b1dbb4f92df99ab29.webm?t=1751566197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034530/extras/de531e1edd17269b1dbb4f92df99ab29.mp4?t=1751566197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034530/extras/b5a0ce5f51af4ba8a9ca6a9bcbd81a3c.webp?t=1751566197\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Solve challenging puzzles and uncover the mysteries hidden behind locked doors. Reveal the secrets of the past step by step and use your intellect to advance.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034530/extras/80bb5656b9ed98f27188bafb5bd28a0d.poster.avif?t=1751566197\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034530/extras/80bb5656b9ed98f27188bafb5bd28a0d.webm?t=1751566197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034530/extras/80bb5656b9ed98f27188bafb5bd28a0d.mp4?t=1751566197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034530/extras/893d5189ff83b7d113719fcb309d5e